use "difference_of_squares.folio" as exercise

to test_square_of_sum
    expect exercise's square_of_sum(1) is 1
    expect exercise's square_of_sum(5) is 225
    expect exercise's square_of_sum(100) is 25502500
end

to test_sum_of_squares
    expect exercise's sum_of_squares(1) is 1
    expect exercise's sum_of_squares(5) is 55
    expect exercise's sum_of_squares(100) is 338350
end

to test_difference
    expect exercise's difference(1) is 0
    expect exercise's difference(5) is 170
    expect exercise's difference(100) is 25164150
end
